{"book": "JHN", "chapter": 2, "lang": "en", "bible": "KJV-2026", "engine": "chatterbox-videos-v1", "durationMs": 163087, "verses": [{"verse": 1, "start": 300, "end": 5687, "text": "And the third day there was a marriage in Cana of Galilee; and the mother of Jesus was there:", "words": [[0, 300], [4, 449], [8, 569], [14, 829], [18, 1229], [24, 1489], [28, 1709], [30, 1829], [39, 2209], [42, 2449], [47, 2949], [50, 3069], [59, 4057], [63, 4187], [67, 4287], [74, 4547], [77, 4767], [83, 5107], [87, 5467]]}, {"verse": 2, "start": 6037, "end": 9742, "text": "And both Jesus was called, and his disciples, to the marriage.", "words": [[0, 6037], [4, 6181], [9, 6441], [15, 6841], [19, 7161], [27, 7581], [31, 8061], [35, 8201], [46, 8721], [49, 9041], [53, 9161]]}, {"verse": 3, "start": 10092, "end": 15605, "text": "And when they wanted wine, the mother of Jesus says to him, They have no wine.", "words": [[0, 10092], [4, 10200], [9, 10340], [14, 10500], [21, 10840], [27, 11780], [31, 11960], [38, 12200], [41, 12420], [47, 12740], [52, 13100], [55, 13340], [60, 13904], [65, 14064], [70, 14304], [73, 14544]]}, {"verse": 4, "start": 15885, "end": 21410, "text": "Jesus says to her, Woman, what have I to do with you? my hour is not yet come.", "words": [[0, 15885], [6, 16125], [11, 16465], [14, 16685], [19, 17239], [26, 18030], [31, 18330], [36, 18530], [38, 18650], [41, 18790], [44, 18950], [49, 19190], [54, 19683], [57, 19826], [62, 20186], [65, 20486], [69, 20686], [73, 20886]]}, {"verse": 5, "start": 21690, "end": 25827, "text": "His mother says to the servants, Whatever he says to you, do it.", "words": [[0, 21690], [4, 21812], [11, 22092], [16, 22472], [19, 22712], [23, 22852], [33, 23681], [42, 24009], [45, 24289], [50, 24489], [53, 24749], [58, 25269], [61, 25449]]}, {"verse": 6, "start": 26107, "end": 34834, "text": "And there were set there six waterpots of stone, after the manner of the purifying of the Jews, containing two or three firkins apiece.", "words": [[0, 26107], [4, 26276], [10, 26456], [15, 26636], [19, 26996], [25, 27256], [29, 27826], [39, 28396], [42, 28596], [49, 29356], [55, 29736], [59, 29956], [66, 30276], [69, 30556], [73, 30676], [83, 31256], [86, 31536], [90, 31676], [96, 32416], [107, 32796], [111, 33216], [114, 33416], [120, 33696], [128, 34156]]}, {"verse": 7, "start": 35184, "end": 40469, "text": "Jesus says to them, Fill the waterpots with water. And they filled them up to the brim.", "words": [[0, 35184], [6, 35534], [11, 35874], [14, 36114], [20, 36719], [25, 36929], [29, 37319], [39, 37709], [44, 37949], [51, 38752], [55, 38915], [60, 39075], [67, 39335], [72, 39575], [75, 39695], [78, 39855], [82, 39975]]}, {"verse": 8, "start": 40819, "end": 46128, "text": "And he says to them, Draw out now, and bear to the governor of the feast. And they took it.", "words": [[0, 40819], [4, 40963], [7, 41063], [12, 41283], [15, 41503], [21, 42023], [26, 42199], [30, 42559], [35, 42839], [39, 43219], [44, 43539], [47, 43759], [51, 43899], [60, 44199], [63, 44439], [67, 44539], [74, 45299], [78, 45445], [83, 45565], [88, 45765]]}, {"verse": 9, "start": 46478, "end": 56906, "text": "When the ruler of the feast had tasted the water that was made wine, and knew not from where it was: (but the servants which drew the water knew;) the governor of the feast called the bridegroom,", "words": [[0, 46478], [5, 46605], [9, 46725], [15, 47005], [18, 47245], [22, 47365], [28, 47645], [32, 47865], [39, 48185], [43, 48425], [49, 48725], [54, 48925], [58, 49085], [63, 49305], [69, 49665], [73, 50005], [78, 50205], [82, 50445], [87, 50665], [93, 50865], [96, 51005], [101, 51700], [106, 51885], [110, 52065], [119, 52425], [125, 52765], [130, 53065], [134, 53285], [140, 53855], [147, 54425], [151, 54485], [160, 54805], [163, 55085], [167, 55225], [173, 55545], [180, 55945], [184, 56425]]}, {"verse": 10, "start": 57256, "end": 66091, "text": "And says to him, Every man at the beginning does set forth good wine; and when men have well dr